  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "CoC-Nusc",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tnuScenes \u2192 PhysicalAI-AV (PAD) format + Chain-of-Causation labels\n\t\n\nnuScenes v1.0-trainval converted to the NVIDIA PhysicalAI-AV (PAD) dataset\nlayout, with Chain-of-Causation (CoC) reasoning labels generated by the\nalpamayo-coc-autolabeler\nusing Qwen3.5-35B-A3B. Built to run Alpamayo 1.5 SFT on nuScenes without the\ngated 133 TB PAD dataset.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tContents\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nPath\nWhat\n\n\n\t\t\nlabels/egomotion/*.zip\nEgo trajectory (15-col parquet per clip) from nuScenes CAN bus 50 Hz\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/YSHRobotics/CoC-Nusc.",
  "alternateName": [
    "YSHRobotics/CoC-Nusc",
    "nuScenes CoC (PhysicalAI-AV format)"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "SuHan Yoon",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/YSHRobotics"
  },
